    info
        - `susurration.Transport`, the transport layer, reached from the umbrella as `Ssh.Transport`
        + `susurration.Transport`, la couche transport, accessible depuis le package parapluie par
        + `Ssh.Transport`
    detail
        - A type alias and a companion value, so that `Ssh.Transport(duplex, host, port)` and
        - `Ssh.Transport.Negotiated` are the class and its companion. The full account is on
        - `susurration.Transport`.
